          {
            "title": "Example: new",
            "id": 108207,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan <code>new</code> untuk membuat instance <code>Animal</code> baru dengan nama <code>\"Rover\"</code> dan spesies <code>\"Canine\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Animal\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, species) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".species = species;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Animal(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rover&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Canine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pet1);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"139\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Animal { name: 'Rover', species: 'Canine' }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>new Animal(\"Rover\", \"Canine\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
